Subject: [PATCH] HPU DSA: top-k KV gather in MLA latent space replaces the L x
 L prefill mask and the decode block bias

Prefill keeps the dense kernel output for rows whose visible prefix is <= topk + kpool - 1 (bit-identical to dense
mode) and recomputes later rows from the 2051 selected latents per query in 1024-row chunks. Decode attends over
the 2051 selected physical KV slots of each sequence. Selection rule unchanged (HF-verified).

